version: "0.1.2"
date-released: "2026-10-08"
abstract: >-
  Illustrative, offline Python prototype for validating and deterministically
  scoring caller-mapped numeric trace data. It accepts 512-value frames,
  partitions them into sixteen contiguous blocks, and reports reproducible
  scores, validation failures, hashes, and descriptive metrics for supplied
  labels. Research software; synthetic examples only; no operational,
  safety, medical, or process-control claims.
